<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Aug 18.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of Aug 18.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT----date---indicator---------period----previous</p>
<p>    0730   19/8   nsa unemployment  May-July  376,000 Apr-June</p>
<p>    0730   21/8   trade balance     May	 NLG +2.6 bln</p>
<p>    0730   22/8   retail sales	June	6.3 pct rise y/y</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
